  "subtopic": "type_hints",
  "title": "Binding aliases",
  "summary": "The bindings of a container's elements keep the aliases the container was declared with",
  "prose": "Iterating a `std::map<std::string, Point>` shows each key as a\n`const string`, not as `basic_string<char>`. Two aliases of one type,\nor an alias and the type itself, leave it unaliased.",
  "status": "supported",
